OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry but somewhat cloudy
OL,6,Fto start but bright or sunny spells
OL,7,Fdeveloping through the day, as well
OL,8,Fthe odd shower, mostly affecting the
OL,9,FWestern Isles, gentle northerly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry start to the evening
OL,12,Fbut cloud thickening with some rain
OL,13,Fspreading north thought the night,
OL,14,Fheavier at times for Lochaber, Skye
OL,15,Fand Lochalsh.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA damp day on Sunday with
OL,18,Foutbreaks of rain for most areas,
OL,19,Fperhaps Caithness seeing the best of
OL,20,Fany dry weather.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
