OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FAn
OL,6,Funsettled start to the week with
OL,7,Fperiods of showers and rain, perhaps
OL,8,Fsome brighter conditions for Tuesday,
OL,9,Fa little uncertain by midweek but risk
OL,10,Fof strong winds and rain.
